# Allegro: stated in musaelian2023allegro (arXiv 2204.05249): "In both the present work and in NequIP, the representation ... takes the form of a direct sum of irreducible representations"; confirmed by Blazej Grabowski, 2026-10-22 (NequIP came first, with message passing; Allegro was developed later as a faster model that approximates NequIP).
