entity:GRACE mlips:derivedFromMethod entity:ACE .

# MACE: stated in batatia2022 (arXiv 2206.07697v2), Sec. 3 and 4: MACE placed in the multi-ACE framework, "extending the ACE framework"; confirmed by Jong Hyun Jung, 2026-10-22 ("MACE was derived from ACE, as MACE added the message passing feature").
entity:MACE mlips:derivedFromMethod entity:ACE .

# MACE-LES: stated in kim2025, Abstract and Sec. II.
entity:MACE-LES mlips:derivedFromMethod entity:MACE .

