entity:sGDML mlips:derivedFromMethod entity:GDML .

# Spin-Allegro: stated in yu2024, Introduction ('the detailed design of Spin-Dimenet++ and Spin-Allegro based on the popular Dimenet++ and Allegro').
entity:Spin-Allegro mlips:derivedFromMethod entity:Allegro .

# Spin-Allegro++: stated in yu2024physics, The SpinGNN++ framework ('an extension of the original SpinGNN framework to account for spin-orbit coupling effects').
